<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*326 Da sön de Schap rewa gegange.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Natangen.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Frischbier<hi rendition="#sup">2</hi>, 3238.</hi></p>                <lb/>
