<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">23 Es schlaffen nit all, die die augen zu hond.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Franck, I, 78<hi rendition="#sup">a</hi>; Petri, II, 523; Lehmann, II, 138, 97; Coler, 589<hi rendition="#sup">a</hi>; Schottel, 1120<hi rendition="#sup">b</hi>; Sailer, 270; Oec. rur., 576; Winckler, XX, 87; Frischbier<hi rendition="#sup">2</hi>, 3315; Braun, I, 3878.</hi></p>                <lb/>
