<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Span.</hi>: Quien amaga y noda, miedo-la. (<hi rendition="#i">Bohn I, 246.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">26 Me schlôt ehnder (eher) zwe Düfle-n-yne, gäb (bevor) eine-n use.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Solothurn.</hi>) &#x2013; Schild, 58, 32.</p>                <lb/>
