<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">* Se hôt e gent Schleifes<hi rendition="#sup">1</hi>.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Siebenbürg.-sächs.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Frommann, V, 35, 68.</hi></p>                <lb/>
