<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">2 Es wil niemand gern der schlimste seyn.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Petri, II, 304.</hi></p>                <lb/>
</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Schlimmstes.</hi></head>                <lb/>
