</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Schmitzen.</hi></head>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">* Der gêt nit von schmützen.</hi></p>                <lb/>
