<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">145 Wâr lêpe<hi rendition="#sup">1</hi> Schwînen fröten<hi rendition="#sup">2</hi> is 't hard.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Stürenburg, 61<hi rendition="#sup">b</hi>.</hi></p>                <lb/>
