<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">
<pb facs="#f0253" n="[247]"/>
<cb n="493"/>
*58 As em sine Sêle un Êre lêv is.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Dähnert, 419<hi rendition="#sup">b</hi>.</hi></p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et">So lieb ihm Leben und Ehre ist.</p>                <lb/>
