<p rendition="#et">Beim Würfelspiel.</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*28 Sieben auff einen schlag.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Gruter, III, 81; Lehmann, II, 577, 77.</hi></p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*29 Siebene grad seyn lassen.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Simplic., I, 15.</hi></p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*30 'T is drêmal säöb'n, 't is buten sîn Verstand.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Bueren, 1112; Hauskalender, III.</hi></p>                <lb/>
