<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Engl.</hi>: To sit like a wire drawer under his work. (<hi rendition="#i">Bohn II, 61.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*109 Er sitzt wie in Abraham's Schos.</hi></p>                <lb/>
