<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*31 Den Spott zum Schaden han.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Eiselein, 542; Rollwagenbüchlein, XLII; Pauli, Schimpff, V<hi rendition="#sup">a</hi>; Theatrum Diabolorum, 445<hi rendition="#sup">b</hi>, 1; Eyering, II, 362.</hi></p>                <lb/>
