<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Dän.</hi>: Stakket stav gjør stakket spring. (<hi rendition="#i">Prov. dan., 529.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Lat.</hi>: Si brevior baculus, erit hinc tibi brevior saltus. &#x2013; Transiliisse potest nullus procul absque bacillo.</p>                <lb/>
