</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Stapfen.</hi></head>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">An den Stapfen kann man sehen, ob ein Pferd oder Fuchs gegangen ist.</hi></p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Böhm.</hi>: Vic chei &#x010D;ty&#x0159;em kolám v&#x010D;&#x0159;iti, ne&#x017E; t&#x010D;y&#x0159;em nohám ko&#x0148;skyn. (<hi rendition="#i">&#x010C;elakovsky, 255.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Stappen.</hi></head>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">* He stappt<hi rendition="#sup">1</hi> as 'n Pogg in'n Manenschîn<hi rendition="#sup">2</hi>.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Oldenburg.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Firmenich, I, 232, 12.</hi></p>                <lb/>
