<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*15 He satt so stîf as en Hoppenstaken.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Holst.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Schütze, II, 161.</hi></p>                <lb/>
