<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*20 So stîf as en Oakshoaren<hi rendition="#sup">1</hi>.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Grafschaft Mark.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Frommann, V, 163, 168.</hi></p>                <lb/>
