<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">30 Henger âl Stöck es gôt schule<hi rendition="#sup">1</hi>.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Düren.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Firmenich, I, 483, 51.</hi></p>                <lb/>
