</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Strich.</hi></head>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">1 Die stärksten Striche geben nicht gerade die schönste Musik.</hi></p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Engl.</hi>: The greatest strokes make noth the best musik. (<hi rendition="#i">Bohn II, 19.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">2 Gôd Sträk, segt Strûk, un krîgt sîn Frû bîn Bûk.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Hoefer, 1013.</hi></p>                <lb/>
