<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">343 Kein Tag ohne Plag (Klag).</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Lehmann, II, 321, 46.</hi></p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Engl.</hi>: No day passes without some grief. (<hi rendition="#i">Bohn II, 5.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
