<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">It.</hi>: L' abbondanza delle vivande porta seco sozze voglie. (<hi rendition="#i">Pazzaglia, 2.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">18 Ueberfluss verdirbt den Genuss.</hi></p>                <lb/>
