<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Engl.</hi>: Birds of a feather flock together. (<hi rendition="#i">Gaal, 1630.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Holl.</hi>: Vogels van eenerlei oeren vliegen gaarne zamen. (<hi rendition="#i">Harrebomée, II, 401<hi rendition="#sup">b</hi>.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Ill.</hi>: Svaka ptica svomu jatu ide. (<hi rendition="#i">&#x010C;elakovsky, 38.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
