<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">30 Wenn's man wôr is, sagt Schûster, dar lêwt he noch.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Mecklenburg.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Hoefer, 963.</hi></p>                <lb/>
