</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Waldvögelein.</hi></head>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">1 Rath nuh, liebes walduögelein, wer thut dir vnder den gsellen dein.</hi></p>                <lb/>
