<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Lat.</hi>: Ex syngrapha agere. (<hi rendition="#i">Erasm., 814; Faselius, 80; Philippi, I, 145.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Wechselwagen.</hi></head>                <lb/>
