</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Wedde.</hi></head>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">Up enne Wedde mott me nêrgen hinnegohn, dat hät doch kenne Ôrt.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Waldeck.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Curtze, 332, 224.</hi></p>                <lb/>
</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Wedel.</hi></head>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">1 Seigs Wedel<hi rendition="#sup">1</hi> oder Neu<hi rendition="#sup">2</hi>, wenn gut Wetter ist, so heu.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Luzern.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
